<title>THAILAND: Saha Pathana Q4 net up 21 percent.</title>
<headline>Saha Pathana Q4 net up 21 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Fourth quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 3.96     vs	     3.27</p>
<p>    Net			195.38     vs	   161.65</p>
<p>				   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     12.31	vs	    10.39</p>
<p>    Net		     607.88	vs	   537.85</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Saha Pathana Inter-Holdings Plc. It is a holding company for firms in a variety of businesses.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
